• Docs: the sentence in docs/src/usage/commands.md saying the -o file name must be one word was replaced with the quoted-path rule and an example. src/help_data.rs doesn't state the one-word rule, so it was correctly left alone.
• Product surface: this is a product task and no defaults, config or startup behaviour changed.

